  RootNode:
    dialogueText: 'Public Notice

      

      Dear all,

      

      As of
      this Monday, additional rules will be in place. These new rules cover safety
      for hopping between lily pads; catching flies in an orderly manner and correct
      swimming postures to avoid collision.

      

      We hope you will implement
      these rules as quickly as you are able. If you require an exception please
      complete forms 5-47 and 23-03.

      

      Regards,

      

      Royal
      Office of Public Safety'
    responses:
    - responseText: Stop Reading
